# A mod's new hull with pictures of its own in the ship designer (docs/sdk/packages-and-data.md):
# the fixture mod tests/fixtures/mods/escort-hull adds the Escort Carrier, which needs no
# technology, and its Mini_ and Portrait_ pictures come from the mod's assets/ folder.
options --quick-start=Terran --seed=7 --open=designs --layout=1024x768 --size=1280x800 --mod=tests/fixtures/mods/escort-hull

wait-window designs
click tag:designs:create
click item:Ship in=designs
wait-window create-design
click item:##size in=create-design
click item:"Escort Carrier (350 kT)"
wait 3
assert { design_hull_chosen = true }
screenshot mod-hull-designer.png
wait 2
key Escape
wait-closed create-design
